    {
      "id": "claim_7542ca9208e4490386d80421cf8118d1",
      "statement": "LumuxApp subclasses Adw.Application with application ID io.github.enginkirmaci.lumux and FLAGS_NONE, and registers Python signal handlers for SIGTERM and SIGINT in __init__ so the system can request a clean shutdown.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/lumux/__main__.py#L23-L36",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c12f9dddcb0179b5dc05e46a361dc820b079c68153cffceb11191633b2bffe5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4d43f1a9b8f14aea9e44d68809ab9b70",
      "statement": "The signal handler prints the received signal and defers _quit_safely to the GLib main loop via GLib.idle_add; _quit_safely sets main_window._quitting to True before calling self.quit() so the window does not minimize to the tray on a real shutdown.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/lumux/__main__.py#L38-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7d0e38a0f763bca389783d86d327ea142fe817eba01ffa84c428cbde54914ae1:"
