      "statement": "The on_activate startup sequence is: re-present an existing window, force the Adwaita dark color scheme, set up the app icon, create the SettingsManager singleton, construct AppContext and call its start() to bootstrap the bridge, construct MainWindow, then present or hide it based on ui.minimize_at_startup.",
